        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuti mgasunjile maloŵe gangu gakuti mpimilile, Une soni tinjimsunga pa ndaŵi ja malinjiko jele jikwisa mcilambo cosope capasi, kuti ŵandu wosope ŵakutama mwelemo talinjidwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngwisa pangakaŵa. Mcikamulisye mnope cele cimkwete, kuti jwine akamsumula mbote jenu jajikulosya kuti mpundile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwele jutacipunda, tinjimtenda kuŵa misati jakutamilicika ja Nyumba ja AMBUJE ŵangu. Ngasakopokamo, soni pa jwalakwejo tinjilemba lina lya Mlungu jwangu, ni lya msinda wa Mlungu jwangu, wele uli Yelusalemu jwasambano, wele tiwuciyika pacilambo capasi pano kutyocela kwinani kwa Mlungu jwangu. Pa jwalakwejo, tinjilemba soni lina lyangu lyasambano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
